## AI assistance disclosure

The project used AI-assisted vibe coding for implementation, refactoring,
testing, documentation and review. AI systems are tools, not legal authors or
release owners. LAI ZEYU selected the product direction, supplied constraints,
reviewed outputs and remains accountable for the distributed work.

Community contributors should be credited through Git commit history and, when
their contribution is substantial, by adding their name here with permission.

